{"event":"script","name":"c1_01-tape-record","note":"U-07: legacy C1_01 with the DBSIM argument -rc1tape (registry game_arguments): control_record step 7 appends one tape record per call to c1tape.tap in the clone root (the tape transaction reports its size and hash and removes it). Queued keys = - [ ], Space (R+16h, R+0Dh), a Num7 tap inside one frame (U[0] -> R+17h), two right clicks (mouse events), Ctrl+B (430h), Alt+S twice (freeze on/off while recording), turn, throttle. Bounded window of 600 frames."}
